#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-led-neopixel.rst:4
#: 5e2d6223e7ec4cfeac7eccb48808e934
msgid "NeoPixel"
msgstr "NeoPixel"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-led-neopixel.rst:8
#: c209c54e14694da586ce18a9493d7005
msgid ""
"Up to four strings of \"NeoPixel\" style (WS2812B compatible) RGB LEDs can "
"be used to display the same LED patterns as other RGB LEDs including those "
"commonly installed on GPS/compass units.  Each string can have multiple LEDs"
" with the maximum number dependent upon the autopilot's CPU speed.  On a "
"high speed autopilot with an H7 processor, up to 44 individual LEDs per "
"string are known to work."
msgstr ""
"最多四串「NeoPixel」风格（兼容WS2812B）RGB LED可用于显示与其他RGB "
"LED（包括GPS/罗盘单元上常见安装的LED）相同的LED模式。每串可有多颗LED，最大数量取决于飞控CPU速度。在配备H7处理器的高速飞控上，每串最多44颗独立LED已知可正常工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-led-neopixel.rst:10
#: 8265d6045b574e7d93cbda87ed624d2b
msgid ""
"Attach each LED to a separate PWM output and set the following parameters"
msgstr "将每个LED连接到单独的PWM输出并设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-led-neopixel.rst:12
#: d8ee3a6040ce4ff68813629d81500c36
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`NTF_LED_TYPES<NTF_LED_TYPES>` to include ``NeoPixel`` (bit 8)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`NTF_LED_TYPES<NTF_LED_TYPES>` 设置为包含 ``NeoPixel`` （第8位）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-led-neopixel.rst:13
#: f86122a7d65e47608238e0617e4983b6
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`NTF_LED_LEN<NTF_LED_LEN>` to the number of LEDs connected to a "
"servo output (up to 4)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`NTF_LED_LEN<NTF_LED_LEN>` 设置为连接到舵机输出的LED数量（最多4）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-led-neopixel.rst:14
#: 828cf64766a84bd9b13ad27d22292644
msgid ""
"Set SERVOx_FUNCTION to ``NeoPixel1``, ``NeoPixel2``, ``NeoPixel3`` or "
"``NeoPixel4`` where \"x\" corresponds to the PWM output channel that the LED"
" is connected to"
msgstr ""
"将SERVOx_FUNCTION设置为 ``NeoPixel1``、``NeoPixel2``、``NeoPixel3`` 或 "
"``NeoPixel4``，其中「x」对应LED连接的PWM输出通道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-led-neopixel.rst:16
#: ca9651904fca4779b1b6212c208c39c3
msgid ""
"a few \"NeoPixel\" LED types have a different data order for the red and "
"green data instead of the normal green/red/blue orde. If you are not "
"displaying the desired colors, try setting the "
":ref:`NTF_LED_TYPES<NTF_LED_TYPES>` parameter to ``NeoPixelRGB`` tpe "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"少数「NeoPixel」LED类型的红色和绿色数据顺序与正常的绿/红/蓝顺序不同。如果显示颜色不正确，请尝试将 "
":ref:`NTF_LED_TYPES<NTF_LED_TYPES>` 参数改为 ``NeoPixelRGB`` 类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-led-neopixel.rst:18
#: ef1724a9367b46c9ab9653d670404f12
msgid ""
"Most WS2812 style LED and strings will operate correctly when connected to "
"the autopilot. However, if you get intermittent or non-operation, you may "
"need to implement one of the configurations below. This is due to the fact "
"that the autopilot outputs swing to 3.3V but the worst case input signal "
"high spec for the LED is 4.3V at a 5V supply. So at extremes of "
"tolerance/manufacturing spec, you can get a combination which will not work "
"correctly. In that case the easiest solution is to lower the LED supply as "
"shown below."
msgstr ""
"大多数WS2812风格的LED和灯带连接到飞控时可正常工作。但如果出现间歇性不工作或无法工作的情况，可能需要采用以下配置之一。这是因为飞控输出摆幅为3.3V，而LED在5V供电时信号高电平输入规格的最坏情况为4.3V。因此在公差/制造规格的极端情况下，可能出现无法正常工作的组合。这种情况下最简单的解决方案是降低LED供电电压，如下所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-led-neopixel.rst:23
#: 433af289974a412e9d0b9079657c6d93
msgid ""
"But this causes a small loss in LED brilliance. An easy way to avoid this, "
"if an LED can be isolated in the string, is to use an LED to level shift the"
" signal for you so that the rest of the string can be powered by the full "
"5V."
msgstr ""
"但这会导致LED亮度略有损失。如果能在灯带中隔离一颗LED，可以用该LED为您进行电平转换，使灯带其余部分可以由完整5V供电，从而避免这一问题。"
